verses.text:
Younger ones have seen the light
and have dwelt upon the earth;
but the way of knowledge they have not known,

nor grasped her paths,
nor taken hold of her;
their sons have wandered far from her road.

But the One who knows all things knows her;
he found her out by his understanding.
The One who prepared the earth for time of the age
filled it with four-footed creatures;

And the stars shone in their watches and were glad;
he called them, and they said, “Here we are!”
They shone with gladness for the One who made them.

and did not know his ordinances;
nor did they walk in the ways of God's commandments,
nor tread the paths of discipline in his righteousness.

I have taken off the robe of peace
and put on the sackcloth of my petition;
I will cry out to the Everlasting all my days.
